7
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:21,700
So we want to change the score by one each time our guy gets a header and our guy is getting a header

8
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,560
when he is touching the ball.

9
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:26,620
So if you look at the script here, it's basically doing that.

10
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:28,990
It's sensing if we are touching Ben.

11
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:34,600
So it works perfectly for our variable change and we don't even need to create a new script.

12
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,770
So let's do this.

13
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:42,730
If the ball touches Ben, we want to change our variable score by one and change the ball's direction.

14
00:00:43,290 --> 00:00:44,760
So let's check this out.

15
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:48,570
Clicking play you will see when we get a header it works.

16
00:00:48,570 --> 00:00:53,580
But just before you celebrate too much, see that if we touch the ball from the side.

17
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:58,860
We get a whole stack of points, and that's one way to cheat in our game.

18
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:01,890
That's a bit of a hack, so we definitely need to fix that.

19
00:01:01,890 --> 00:01:08,160
And also notice that when we restart the game, our score stays at the same number.

20
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:16,230
So firstly we can fix our score, not a restarting simply by adding this set variable block to the start

21
00:01:16,230 --> 00:01:16,770
of our script.

22
00:01:16,770 --> 00:01:21,780
And this way each time we start our game, our score is reset to zero.

23
00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:25,520
Our next problem needs a smarter fix.

24
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:31,580
Because if you look at this code, if Ben is touching the ball, it changes the variable by one and

25
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:34,010
it keeps doing this until he's not touching the ball.

26
00:01:34,010 --> 00:01:39,110
So even if we are only touching for a second, the score will increase a bunch of times in that second.

27
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:46,120
So to fix this, add in a wait one second right to the end of the code and we don't even need it to

28
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:46,840
be that long.

29
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,450
So let's change it maybe to half a second.

30
00:01:50,310 --> 00:01:53,610
Now, if you look at the script, we set our score to zero.

31
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:58,770
Then if we touch Ben, we change the direction, change our score.

32
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:02,790
Then we wait for one second, which means that our players can't cheat anymore.

33
00:02:03,660 --> 00:02:05,640
And with that, your scoring is done.

